      "mds:offGasses": "None",
      "mds:procedureDetails": "2,4-Dichloro-N-(3,5-dichloro-4-quinolin-3-ylmethyl-phenyl)-benzenesulfonamide was synthesized (63%) from 3,5-dichloro-4-quinolin-3-ylmethyl-phenylamine (230), 2,4-dichlorobenzenesulfonyl chloride (Maybridge) and pyridine (EM) in a similar manner as described in Examples 70-91. 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 11.34 (br s, 1H), 8.78 (d, J=2.0 Hz, 1H), 8.13 (d, J=8.6 Hz, 1H), 7.97 (d, J=8.6 Hz, 1H), 7.93 (d, J=1.8 Hz, 1H), 7.88 (d, J=7.9 Hz, 1H), 7.80 (s, 1H), 7.73-7.68 (m, 2H), 7.58 (t, J=7.5 Hz, 1H), 7.21 (s, 2H), 4.34 (s, 2H). MS (EI): m/z 509 (M−H).",
